# Shared block: the four confirmation boxes of the save/load screens (load, overwrite, save description, delete). Hidden
# children shown by code; each is a 760 x 320 dialog centred (x 580..1340, y 380..700). Used by SaveLoad (shell) and
# PopupSaveLoad (in game), which have the same window names.
window $LoadConfirmParent centre middle 0 0 760 320 dialog
window text:GUI:LoadGameConfirmation left top 604 404 712 180 body
window $ButtonLoadCancel left top 604 632 180 44 button
window $ButtonLoadConfirm left top 1136 632 180 44 primary

window $OverwriteConfirmParent centre middle 0 0 760 320 dialog
window text:GUI:OverwriteSaveConfirmation left top 604 404 712 180 body
window $ButtonOverwriteCancel left top 604 632 180 44 button
window $ButtonOverwriteConfirm left top 1136 632 180 44 primary

window $SaveDescParent centre middle 0 0 760 320 dialog
window text:GUI:EnterSaveDesc left top 604 404 712 32 caption
window $EntryDesc left top 604 452 712 44 entry
window $ButtonSaveDescCancel left top 604 632 180 44 button
window $ButtonSaveDescConfirm left top 1136 632 180 44 primary

window $DeleteConfirmParent centre middle 0 0 760 320 dialog
window text:GUI:ConfirmDelete left top 604 404 712 180 body
window $ButtonDeleteCancel left top 604 632 180 44 button
window $ButtonDeleteConfirm left top 1136 632 180 44 danger
